# OS
.DS_Store

# Runtime artifacts (regenerated; not source of truth)
Harness-Best-Practice/observability/audit.log
Security-kit/eval/recorded/

# Patch-workflow debris. §5.5 ships protected-path fixes as patches, so *.patch
# stays TRACKABLE on purpose — a patch is an artifact somebody has to review.
# A .rej/.orig is the opposite: proof that a hunk did NOT apply, of no value once
# the outcome is known, and `git add -A` would commit it into the template that
# every project is copied from.
*.rej
*.orig

# Presentation and working material must never ship in the template that every project
# copies. Measured 2026-09-02: a `git add -A template/` had swept ~59 MB of decks,
# exploded .pptx directories and a .tmp/ scratch tree into commit de15f50.
*.pptx
*.inspect.ndjson
Deck/
Harness_*/
.tmp/
.vscode/
.kiro/
import
